</style></head><body>
<h1>Job 2 Specification: meemicToMccaJob (Meemic RFR Monthly Batch Job)</h1>
<h2>1. Executive Summary &amp; Job Overview</h2>
<table>
<tr>
<th>Attribute</th>
<th>Details</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Job Name / ID</b></td>
<td><code>meemicToMccaJob</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Source System</b></td>
<td><b>MEEMIC</b> (Meemic Insurance Company — Flat Files delivered via FTP / GCS Landing Zone)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Schedule / Frequency</b></td>
<td>Monthly (Runs on the 1st of the month at <code>1:00 AM</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Spring XML Configs</b></td>
<td><code>jobs/rfrBatchJob.xml</code> (<code>&lt;batch:job id=&quot;meemicToMccaJob&quot;&gt;</code>), <code>common/beanInfo.xml</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Input Flat Files</b></td>
<td>1. Header File (<code>${meemic.header.file.name}</code> — 19 semicolon-delimited columns)<br/>2. Detail File (<code>${meemic.detail.file.name}</code> — 66 semicolon-delimited columns containing <code>BIL*</code> and <code>CPT*</code> lines)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Staging / Temp Tables</b></td>
<td><code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR</code>, <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code>, <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Main Target Tables</b></td>
<td><code>MCCA_RFR</code>, <code>MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG</code>, <code>MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>External API Called</b></td>
<td><b>MCCA MMS REST API</b> — <code>POST /api/v1/Claim/Rfr</code> (Authenticated via ADFS OAuth2 <code>client_credentials</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Email Notifications</b></td>
<td><code>meemicSuccessMail</code> (Step 9 via <code>MeemicMailImpl.java</code> with Header &amp; Paylog record counts) or <code>meemicRejectMail</code> (if Step 5 <code>FileValidator</code> fails)</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h2>2. End-to-End Architecture &amp; Step Execution Flow</h2>
<p><code>meemicToMccaJob</code> executes <b>10 sequential steps</b> (plus a conditional failure branch to <code>meemicRejectMailStep</code> if file cross-validation fails in Step 5):</p>
<pre>[Step 1: clearMeemicTempTablesBeforeProcess]
       │ (Deletes all rows from MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR, MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG, MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT)
       ▼
[Step 2: rfrHeaderMeemicToDbStep]
       │ (Reads Meemic Header File -&gt; RfrHeaderFieldSetMapper -&gt; RfrHeaderBisToDbProcessor [claimType=&apos;MEEMIC&apos;] -&gt; Inserts into MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR)
       ▼
[Step 3: rfrDetailMeemicToDbStep]
       │ (Reads Meemic Detail File &apos;BIL*&apos; lines -&gt; RfrDetailFieldSetMapper -&gt; RfrDetailBisToDbProcessor [claimType=&apos;MEEMIC&apos;] -&gt; Inserts into MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG)
       ▼
[Step 4: rfrDetailCptMeemicToDbStep]
       │ (Reads Meemic Detail File &apos;CPT*&apos; lines -&gt; RfrDetailCptFieldSetMapper -&gt; RfrDetailCptBisToDbProcessor -&gt; Inserts into MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT)
       ▼
[Step 5: validateMeemicFiles] (FileValidator.java)
       ├──► [Status = FAILED] ──► [meemicRejectMailStep] (Sends file failure email &amp; halts job)
       │
       ▼ [Status = COMPLETED]
[Step 6: rfrMeemicHeaderStep] (RfrHeaderProcessor.java)
       │ (Reads MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR + Paylogs + CPTs -&gt; Runs RFRValidator &amp; March 2022 Rules -&gt; Calls MMS API if valid -&gt; Inserts into MCCA_RFR)
       ▼
[Step 7: rfrMeemicDetailStep]
       │ (Copies all rows from MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG -&gt; MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG)
       ▼
[Step 8: rfrMeemicDetailCptStep]
       │ (Copies all rows from MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT -&gt; MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT)
       ▼
[Step 9: meemicSuccessMailStep] (MeemicMailImpl.java)
       │ (Queries MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR &amp; MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG counts and sends summary email)
       ▼
[Step 10: clearMeemicTempTables]
       │ (Cleans up MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR, MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG, MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT)</pre>
<h2>3. Meemic-Specific Business Rules vs. CPS (bisCpsToMccaJob)</h2>
<table>
<tr>
<th>#</th>
<th>Component / Class</th>
<th>Meemic-Specific Rule in Java Code</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>1</b></td>
<td><code>RfrHeaderBisToDbProcessor.java</code> (Step 2)</td>
<td>Because <code>claimType</code> is <code>&quot;MEEMIC&quot;</code> (<code>BatchConstants.MEEMIC_CLAIM_TYPE</code>), <b>after</b> running <code>RFRValidator.validate(rfr)</code> (which checks <code>totalMccaPaymentReq &gt; totalAmtBilled + totalBillReviewFees</code>), the processor forces <b><code>rfr.setTotalBillReviewFees(0.0)</code></b> before inserting into <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR</code>.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>2</b></td>
<td><code>RfrDetailBisToDbProcessor.java</code> (Step 3)</td>
<td>When <code>claimType</code> is <code>&quot;MEEMIC&quot;</code>, the processor forces three fee/discount fields to zero before inserting into <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code>:<br/>• <b><code>rfrDetail.setBillReviewFees(0.0)</code></b><br/>• <b><code>rfrDetail.setPpoFees(0.0)</code></b><br/>• <b><code>rfrDetail.setPpoOrOtherNegotiatedDiscount(0.0)</code></b></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>3</b></td>
<td><code>MeemicMailImpl.java</code> (Step 9)</td>
<td>Queries staging table counts before Step 10 deletes them:<br/>• <code>SELECT COUNT(1) FROM MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR</code> (<code>headerRecordCount</code>)<br/>• <code>SELECT COUNT(1) FROM MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code> (<code>paylogRecordCount</code>)<br/>And appends to the email body:<br/><code>Total number of Header records processed : &lt;headerRecordCount&gt;</code><br/><code>Total number of Paylog records processed : &lt;paylogRecordCount&gt;</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>4</b></td>
<td>Staging Table Names</td>
<td>Uses <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR</code>, <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code>, and <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code> (and sets <code>CLM_TYPE = &apos;MEEMIC&apos;</code> in <code>MCCA_RFR</code> and <code>MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG</code>).</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h2>4. Detailed Step-by-Step Business Logic, Conditions &amp; SQL Queries</h2>
<h3>Step 1: clearMeemicTempTablesBeforeProcess (DBUtils.java)</h3>
<p>Deletes all rows from <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code>, <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code>, and <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR</code>.</p>
<h3>Step 2: rfrHeaderMeemicToDbStep (RfrHeaderBisToDbProcessor.java &amp; RFRWriter.java)</h3>
<p>1. Sets <code>rfr.recordType = &quot;RFR&quot;</code> and <code>rfr.claimType = &quot;MEEMIC&quot;</code>.</p>
<p>2. Runs <code>RFRValidator.validate(rfr)</code> (<code>isTotalBillAmountValid</code>, <code>isCrossCompanionClaim</code>, <code>isInitial</code>).</p>
<p>3. Forces <code>rfr.setTotalBillReviewFees(0.0)</code>.</p>
<p>4. Verifies <code>carrierId != 0</code> and <code>!carrierClaimNumber.isEmpty()</code>, stores in <code>meemicHeaderMap</code>, and inserts into <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR</code>.</p>
<h3>Step 3: rfrDetailMeemicToDbStep (RfrDetailBisToDbProcessor.java &amp; RFRPayLogWriter.java)</h3>
<p>1. Processes <code>BIL*</code> lines from the 66-column Detail flat file.</p>
<p>2. Verifies <code>meemicHeaderMap.containsKey(uniqueKey)</code>, inherits <code>carrierClaimNumber</code> and <code>carrierId</code>.</p>
<p>3. Forces <code>billReviewFees = 0.0</code>, <code>ppoFees = 0.0</code>, and <code>ppoOrOtherNegotiatedDiscount = 0.0</code>.</p>
<p>4. Truncates <code>payeeOrProvider</code> to <code>50</code> characters, generates <code>paylogUniqueId</code> from <code>MCCA_PAYLOG_ID_SEQ.NEXTVAL</code>, caches in <code>meemicPaylogMap</code>, and inserts into <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code>.</p>
<h3>Step 4: rfrDetailCptMeemicToDbStep (RfrDetailCptBisToDbProcessor.java &amp; RFRPayLogCptWriter.java)</h3>
<p>Processes <code>CPT*</code> lines, links <code>carrierPaylogId</code> via <code>meemicPaylogMap</code> using <code>uniqueKey-eobId-billType-eobRevisionNum-checkNumberKey-alphabetKey</code>, and inserts into <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code>.</p>
<h3>Step 5: validateMeemicFiles (FileValidator.java)</h3>
<p>Cross-validates Header, Paylog, and CPT staging tables. Routes to <code>meemicRejectMailStep</code> on failure.</p>
<h3>Step 6: rfrMeemicHeaderStep (RfrHeaderProcessor.java, RFRValidator.java, RfrRestClient.java)</h3>
<p>Validates each header, paylog, and CPT line against all 12 RFR validation rules (including March 2022 <code>TIN</code>/<code>NPI</code>, <code>ubBillType</code>, <code>cptCode</code>, <code>revenueCode</code>, and <code>payCode</code>/<code>billType</code> cross-checks). Submits valid claims (<code>pendingStatus == false</code>) to <code>POST /api/v1/Claim/Rfr</code> (<code>STATUS = &apos;SB&apos;</code> on HTTP 2xx, or <code>&apos;PN&apos;</code> + <code>SUBMIT_ERR_MSG</code> on failure) and inserts into <code>MCCA_RFR</code>.</p>
<h3>Step 7: rfrMeemicDetailStep</h3>
<p>Copies all rows from <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code> into <code>MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG</code>.</p>
<h3>Step 8: rfrMeemicDetailCptStep</h3>
<p>Copies all rows from <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code> into <code>MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code>.</p>
<h3>Step 9: meemicSuccessMailStep (MeemicMailImpl.java)</h3>
<p>Queries <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR</code> and <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code> counts and sends completion email.</p>
<h3>Step 10: clearMeemicTempTables (DBUtils.java)</h3>
<p>Clears <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code>, <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code>, and <code>MCCA_MEEMIC_TMP_RFR</code>.</p>
</body></html>
